{"id":"d09","tag":"{\"model\":\"qwen25c3b-8k\",\"variant\":\"compact\",\"k\":8,\"budget\":3000,\"mcpf\":3,\"maxTokens\":200}","split":"dev","type":"flow","question":"Bagaimana ky menegakkan batas ukuran respons (maxResponseSize)?","status":"answer","answer":"Ky menegakkan batas ukuran respons menggunakan fungsi `limitResponseSize` yang terletak di file `source/utils/body.ts`. Fungsi ini memeriksa apakah body respons sudah melebihi batas yang ditentukan (`maxResponseSize`). Jika ya, fungsi ini menghasilkan objek `ResponseSizeError` dan menghentikan proses pengambilan data respons.","cites":"","valid_cites":0,"unverified":0,"uncited":1,"refused":0,"refused_correct":"","false_refusal":0,"context_has_ref":1,"context_ref_recall":0.5,"cite_hits_ref":0,"cite_ref_recall":0,"tokens_in":1278,"tokens_out":89,"usage_source":"provider","latency_ms":1823,"nilai_manual":"","catatan":""}
{"id":"d10","tag":"{\"model\":\"qwen25c3b-8k\",\"variant\":\"compact\",\"k\":8,\"budget\":3000,\"mcpf\":3,\"maxTokens\":200}","split":"dev","type":"flow","question":"Bagaimana ky memvalidasi hasil JSON dengan schema dan galat apa yang dilempar bila gagal?","status":"answer","answer":"Ky memvalidasi hasil JSON dengan schema menggunakan fungsi `validateJsonWithSchema`. Jika validasi gagal, ia akan menghasilkan `SchemaValidationError`. Bila validasi gagal, `SchemaValidationError` akan dilempar dengan properti `issues` yang berisi detail kesalahan validasi.","cites":"","valid_cites":0,"unverified":0,"uncited":1,"refused":0,"refused_correct":"","false_refusal":0,"context_has_ref":1,"context_ref_recall":0.667,"cite_hits_ref":0,"cite_ref_recall":0,"tokens_in":1241,"tokens_out":65,"usage_source":"provider","latency_ms":1455,"nilai_manual":"","catatan":""}
{"id":"d11","tag":"{\"model\":\"qwen25c3b-8k\",\"variant\":\"compact\",\"k\":8,\"budget\":3000,\"mcpf\":3,\"maxTokens\":200}","split":"dev","type":"flow","question":"Bagaimana ky melaporkan progres unggahan (onUploadProgress)?","status":"answer","answer":"Ky melaporkan progres unggahan melalui fungsi `onUploadProgress` yang didefinisikan dalam file `source/types/options.ts`. Fungsi ini menerima dua parameter: `progress` dan `chunk`. `progress` adalah objek yang berisi informasi tentang prosentase dan jumlah byte yang telah ditransfer, sementara `chunk` adalah data yang telah dikirim. Proses ini dilakukan dengan menggunakan fungsi `streamRequest` yang didefinisikan dalam file `source/utils/body.ts`.","cites":"","valid_cites":0,"unverified":0,"uncited":1,"refused":0,"refused_correct":"","false_refusal":0,"context_has_ref":1,"context_ref_recall":0.667,"cite_hits_ref":0,"cite_ref_recall":0,"tokens_in":1759,"tokens_out":115,"usage_source":"provider","latency_ms":2499,"nilai_manual":"","catatan":""}
